flowchart TB
  accTitle: Spectra maintenance: separate update and doctor paths with preservation boundaries
  accDescr: Update checks an installed or recognized legacy project and refreshes only when needed and confirmed; a newer CLI can change the installation outside the project. Doctor reports health without writes; doctor --fix refreshes generated project assets and repairs missing adapters only when safe. Preserved information is a boundary, not a subsequent action. Explicit adapter regeneration is a separate user command. Groups M1 to M4 have matching HTML explanations.
  subgraph MAINT_UPDATE["M1 · Update installed versions and layout"]
    direction TB
    UPDATE["COMMAND · spectra update<br/>Read published version and<br/>project metadata"]
    NEED["CONDITION · Change needed?<br/>CLI, runtime,<br/>schema or layout"]
    CHOICE["RESULT / CHOICE<br/>Already current: no project<br/>refresh<br/>Change needed: ask<br/>confirmation<br/>Declined: project unchanged<br/>--yes skips the prompt, not<br/>validation"]
    REFRESH["RESULT · When needed and<br/>confirmed<br/>Refresh runtime, owned<br/>guides, launcher<br/>and install metadata"]
    CLI["CONDITIONAL RESULT<br/>Newer CLI: update installation<br/>outside the project<br/>Legacy layout: migrate<br/>recognized<br/>Spectra paths into .spectra/"]
    UPDATE -->|compares versions and layout| NEED
    NEED -->|report result and request consent if needed| CHOICE
    CHOICE -.->|change needed and confirmed| REFRESH
    REFRESH -.->|only when each condition applies| CLI
  end
  subgraph MAINT_DOCTOR["M2 · Inspect or repair local health"]
    direction TB
    DOCTOR["COMMAND · spectra doctor"]
    REPORT["RESULT · Health report<br/>No project files written"]
    FIX["COMMAND · spectra doctor<br/>--fix"]
    REPAIR["RESULT · Refresh generated<br/>project assets<br/>Runtime, guides, launcher,<br/>metadata and exclude"]
    SAFE["CONDITION · All true?<br/>Detected set missing files<br/>Required tool available<br/>No user-owned siblings"]
    ADAPTER_REPAIR["RESULT · Repair safe missing<br/>adapter set"]
    MANUAL["RESULT · Report remaining<br/>health state<br/>Unsafe repairs skipped;<br/>report any manual problems"]
    DOCTOR -->|inspect only| REPORT
    REPORT ~~~ FIX
    FIX -->|repair generated assets| REPAIR
    REPAIR -->|assess missing adapters| SAFE
    SAFE -.->|yes: safe to repair| ADAPTER_REPAIR
    SAFE -->|otherwise: report health and unresolved issues| MANUAL
    ADAPTER_REPAIR ~~~ MANUAL
  end
  subgraph MAINT_PRESERVED["M3 · Preserved project information"]
    direction TB
    KEEP["PRESERVATION BOUNDARY ·<br/>Applies to refresh and<br/>repair<br/>Project memory and business<br/>knowledge<br/>Feature and governance<br/>state;<br/>plugin documents<br/>Unowned guide collisions and<br/>user adapters"]
  end
  subgraph MAINT_ADAPTERS["M4 · Explicit adapter regeneration"]
    direction TB
    ADAPTERS["SEPARATE USER COMMAND ·<br/>spectra adapters<br/>Regenerate Spectra tool<br/>instructions deliberately"]
    HEALTHY["CONDITION · Healthy existing<br/>adapters<br/>Update does not<br/>automatically<br/>regenerate them"]
  end
  %% Invisible links control layout only; these groups are not sequential steps.
  MAINT_UPDATE ~~~ MAINT_DOCTOR
  MAINT_DOCTOR ~~~ MAINT_PRESERVED
  MAINT_PRESERVED ~~~ MAINT_ADAPTERS
  classDef command fill:#ffffff,stroke:#6c5ce7,color:#5143c6,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef result fill:#effcf8,stroke:#007f68,color:#121827,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef condition fill:#fff5df,stroke:#8a5d00,color:#121827,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef neutral fill:#f2f8ff,stroke:#64748b,color:#121827;
  class UPDATE,DOCTOR,FIX,ADAPTERS command;
  class CHOICE,REFRESH,CLI,REPORT,REPAIR,ADAPTER_REPAIR,MANUAL result;
  class NEED,SAFE,HEALTHY condition;
  class KEEP neutral;
